00:08:40.831 --> 00:08:43.233
WE NEED TO LET THE EVIDENCE TAKE

00:08:43.234 --> 00:08:44.000
US WHERE IT IS.

00:08:44.001 --> 00:08:46.035
&gt;&gt; Dan: IT'S JUST AMAZING --

00:08:46.036 --> 00:08:47.036
AND THAT'S NOT GOOD.

00:08:47.037 --> 00:08:47.670
GREG, WILL GO BACK TO YOU.

00:08:47.671 --> 00:08:50.807
&gt;&gt; Dana: HALF OF THE

00:08:50.808 --> 00:08:52.442
POPULATION IN FLORIDA THINK THE

00:08:52.443 --> 00:08:53.977
OTHER HAVE SAID SOMETHING TO

00:08:53.978 --> 00:08:54.677
STEAL THE ELECTION FROM THEM.

00:08:54.678 --> 00:08:56.813
THAT'S NOT GOOD.

00:08:56.814 --> 00:08:58.815
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE DAMS WANT TO MAKE

00:08:58.816 --> 00:08:59.282
AMERICA SUFFER.

00:08:59.283 --> 00:09:01.284
IT'S LIKE DEMANDING AN EXTRA

00:09:01.285 --> 00:09:02.252
INNING.

00:09:02.253 --> 00:09:04.187
I HAVE A NEW NICKNAME FOR BILL

00:09:04.188 --> 00:09:07.791
NELSON.

00:09:07.792 --> 00:09:08.525
RECOUNT DRACULA.

00:09:08.526 --> 00:09:09.592
WE PREDICTED THIS LAST WEEK.

00:09:09.593 --> 00:09:10.593
WE SAID NO MATTER WHAT THE

00:09:10.594 --> 00:09:13.830
OUTCOME WAS, WHETHER THE DEMS

00:09:13.831 --> 00:09:15.231
WIN OR LOSE THEY WILL BE HAPPY.

00:09:15.232 --> 00:09:16.966
THIS IS TOO MUCH OF THEIR LIFE.

00:09:16.967 --> 00:09:19.002
&gt;&gt; Marie: I'M HAPPY.

00:09:19.003 --> 00:09:20.170
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU ARE DIFFERENT,

00:09:20.171 --> 00:09:21.905
MARIE --

00:09:21.906 --> 00:09:25.342
B1 CAN I SAY SOMETHING, I LOST

00:09:26.243 --> 00:09:27.444
&gt;&gt; Dan: I CONCEDED.

00:09:27.445 --> 00:09:30.079
YOU CAN GO ON

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:30.780
"THE DAILY CALLER," I WROTE A

00:09:30.781 --> 00:09:34.451
VERY NICE LETTER TO JOHN

00:09:34.452 --> 00:09:34.784
DELANEY.

00:09:34.785 --> 00:09:41.224
THIS IS TIME TO MOVE ON.

00:09:41.225 --> 00:09:43.059
&gt;&gt; Marie: YOU LET THE ABSENTEE

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.060
VOTES GET COUNTED.

00:09:44.061 --> 00:09:45.595
&gt;&gt; Dan: THAT'S THE RULES!

00:09:45.596 --> 00:09:48.097
WHY DIDN'T SHE POST AFTER

00:09:48.098 --> 00:09:50.767
30 MINUTES?

00:09:50.768 --> 00:09:52.469
&gt;&gt; Marie: SHE WILL TONIGHT.

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:56.372
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE LESSON IS NEVER

00:09:56.373 --> 00:09:57.640
CONCEDE.

00:09:57.641 --> 00:09:58.641
JESSE MADE A GOOD POINT AND WE

00:09:58.642 --> 00:10:03.646
LAUGHED ABOUT IT.

00:10:03.647 --> 00:10:05.215
&gt;&gt; Marie: DON'T CONCEDE.

00:10:05.216 --> 00:10:08.953
AND BILL NELSON NEVER CONCEDED.

